    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:569e72e117968fcc",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "d6ef3175e9d12c61cb41090ac17c8569ec5b28ea3dcc121f8adde429ca44981b",
      "text": "Breakfast at the hotel.\n\nPick up from the hotel at 07:00 am and departure towards Lake Titicaca crossing the Altiplano (High Plateau). After approximately 3 hours arrival in Copacabana. Boat transfer across Lake Titicaca to Sun Island.\n\nVisit of the Palacio del Inca (Pilcokaina Palace), built under the Incan Emperor Tupac Yupanqui. Short hike to the hilltop village of Yumani where we will visit the Escalinata del Inca (Inca’s Stairs) and the Fuente de las 3 Aguas (Sacred Fountain).\n\nLunch in Copacabana. Free time to take pictures of the lake and the Royal Range of the Andes. Short visit to Copacabana Church and the religious sanctuary located in the main square.\n\nReturn to La Paz and transfer to the hotel.\n\nAccommodation at the hotel in La Paz & Overnight.",
